   "subject": "Re: [Israel RUG] Is there an elegant way to set the working directory without providing the whole path each time?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You can use relative paths:<div>setwd(&#39;../../things&#39;)</div><div>You can replace your home directory with the tilde:</div><div>setwd(&#39;~/Dropbox/things&#39;)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_extra\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Jun 20, 2014 at 9:14 AM, Ofrit Lesser <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ofrit....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">The function getwd() returns the absolute path of your working directory.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">So you can use it to get you initial path and the paste to it the rest of the path.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">For example:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"># Set Working Diretory<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">mywd &lt;- &quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> C:/Users/Ayala/Documents</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> &quot;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"># Source code directory<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">setwd(mywd)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"># R code directory<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">R_code_dir &lt;- paste (mywd, &quot;\\\\R-scripts\\\\&quot;,sep=&quot;&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Ofrit<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b>On Behalf Of </b>Ayala Allon<br>\r\n\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, 20 June 2014 10:16 AM<br><b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-...@googlegroups.com</a><br><b>Subject:</b> [Israel RUG] Is there an elegant way to set the working directory without providing the whole path each time?<u></u><u></u></span></p>