urier New&quot;;color:purple\">shortPathName</span></a> but I&#39;m not sure that is the way to go.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n</div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#333333\">I will greatly appreciate a general guidance and not a specific answer because I want to try and figure things on my own.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#333333\">  </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n</div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#333333\">Best,</span><u></u><u></u></p></div>\r\n\r\n<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#333333\">Ayala</span><u></u><u></u></p></div><h3 style=\"background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666666\"><u></u> <u></u></span></h3><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">  <u></u><u></u></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>\r\n\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-g...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497938832000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17sTbCgLg1zccdf7rW6QvS\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></p></div></div></div></div><div><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message becau